WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:01,930
Extract

2
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:24,640
You get a Bojin-level concept entry

3
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:26,080
Even the source

4
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:29,040
It can give the target the ultimate ability to decompose and execute

5
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:32,680
The ice species bred have 100% benign mutations

6
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:34,920
And significantly shorten the growth cycle

7
00:00:47,270 --> 00:00:49,830
Has the level of the Waste Picture Law not reached the realm of demigods yet?

8
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:51,270
It's so hard to survive

9
00:00:51,270 --> 00:00:53,430
No wonder it is rated as a recognized garbage god.

10
00:00:53,630 --> 00:00:58,560
The ranking of these three things is too high

11
00:00:58,950 --> 00:01:00,830
Directly give 50,000 goblins to a single target

12
00:01:00,830 --> 00:01:02,270
Not only is there not enough belief points
